### Hosť: identifikácia stola 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/session
Content-Type: application/json

{"tableId": 2, "token": "dev-token-stol-2"}

> {% client.global.set("guestToken", response.body.token); %}

### Hosť: účet (uloží id účtu)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

> {% client.global.set("accountId", response.body.id); %}

### Hosť: objednávka (bryndzové halušky)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"menuItemId": 4, "quantity": 1}]}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### Hosť: privolanie čašníka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/waiter-call
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Prihlásenie kuchyne
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "kuchyna", "password": "casnik2026"}

> {% client.global.set("kitchenToken", response.body.token); %}

### Prihlásenie čašníka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "casnik", "password": "casnik2026"}

> {% client.global.set("waiterToken", response.body.token); %}

### Kuchyňa: zoznam – objednávka nepotvrdeného účtu v ňom nie je
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### Kuchyňa: zmena stavu pred potvrdením účtu → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "IN_PREPARATION"}

### Čašník: prehľad stolov (uloží id privolania)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

> {% client.global.set("waiterCallId", response.body.find(t => t.accountId == client.global.get("accountId")).waiterCallId); %}

### Čašník: potvrdenie účtu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/accounts/{{accountId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Čašník: druhé potvrdenie → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/accounts/{{accountId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Kuchyňa: zoznam – objednávka už je v ňom
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### Kuchyňa: preskočenie stavu (NEW → READY) → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "READY"}

### Kuchyňa: stav, ktorý nastavuje čašník → 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DELIVERED"}

### Kuchyňa: pripravuje sa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "IN_PREPARATION"}

### Kuchyňa: hotová
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "READY"}

### Čašník: prehľad stolov – hotová objednávka v readyOrders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Čašník: privolanie vybavené
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/waiter-calls/{{waiterCallId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Čašník: objednávka doručená
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/orders/{{orderId}}/delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Hosť: účet – história má štyri stavy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Čašník: zaplatené u čašníka – účet sa uzavrie
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/accounts/{{accountId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Hosť: uzavretý účet → 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Čašník na adrese kuchyne → 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}